        "gg-WN-UuJB0_text": "<p>“My wife noticed before I did.”</p>",
        "gg0n75b_rer_text": "<p>“Didn’t expect much… but wow.”</p>",
        "gg1Q_r-Dj2t_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2005/9307/files/gempages_432750572815254551-c9f13168-bf8f-4318-a82e-bac41c11e37e.png?v=1715673277",
        "gg1Q_r-Dj2t_srcSet_mobile_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0896/0851/9991/files/wo-blackguyTEST.webp",
        "gg3jSHaeT22_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#242424;\"><strong>ANTHONY R</strong></span></p>",
        "gg4j9XLzfnS_childItem_0": "<p>Verified Buyer</p>",
        "ggFK9Asl98p_text": "<p>2900+ Customers Who Love Us</p>",
        "ggIQJITtQ6r_text": "Hear from Our Customers",
        "ggQTV-aeDs6_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#242424;\"><strong>Marcus T</strong></span></p>",
        "ggS6YOamf6u_text": "<p>I’ve tried capsules before but always forget to take them. The gummies made it easy. After about a month I noticed strength coming back in the gym, but what really sold me was overall drive and confidence. Even my wife asked what I was doing differently. That alone made it worth it.</p>",
        "ggUXXyQ27nh_text": "<p>“I didn’t want to go the TRT route, so I looked for natural options. Been using Chad Bites daily and the difference is real — recovery is faster, sleep feels deeper, and I wake up ready to go instead of dragging. Taste is solid too which helps me stay consistent.”</p>",
        "ggVGCX1rdNw_text": "<p><strong>DEREK M</strong></p>",
        "ggZ7MlQhDKe_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2005/9307/files/gempages_432750572815254551-0f3f1b4e-bdf7-450b-82c1-89dfc5a87e26.png?v=1715673242",
        "ggZ7MlQhDKe_srcSet_mobile_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0896/0851/9991/files/wo-anthonyTEST.webp",
        "ggbB0bgNxVu_childItem_0": "<p>Verified Buyer</p>",
        "ggbTd1q61qx_text": "<p>I’m 54 and was feeling completely drained by mid-day. Workouts were flat, motivation was gone. I started Chad Bites mostly out of curiosity — within about 2–3 weeks my energy picked up big time. Better pumps, better mood, and I’m not crashing after work anymore. Honestly feels like I turned the clock back a few years.”</p>",
        "ggd4eWr4qB8_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2005/9307/files/gempages_432750572815254551-f132cfa5-ab01-4656-bf4a-f0e5a90a2fb3.png?v=1715673234",
        "ggd4eWr4qB8_srcSet_mobile_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0896/0851/9991/files/wo-DerekTEST.webp",
